[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/dag_engine_lite/lib/dag_engine_lite_impl.py: Fixed three runtime bugs: (1) Added _sync_states() call in mark_failed FAIL_FAST to ensure all nodes are initialized before transitioning non-terminal nodes to CANCELLED. (2) Added _sync_states() call in mark_succeeded to ensure all dependents are in _states before promoting PENDING nodes to READY. (3) Fixed retries_attempted to only count retries (attempts beyond the initial one) by adding attempt > 0 guard.
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/dag_engine_lite/tests/dag_engine_lite_impl_test.py: Resolved feedback: (1) Fixed test_remove_node_removes_definition_and_edges to not call get_dependents on removed node — replaced uncontracted assertion with has_node check. (2) Fixed three failure policy tests (FAIL_FAST, SKIP_DOWNSTREAM, CONTINUE_ON_ERROR) where independent root node 'c' was incorrectly asserted as PENDING — root nodes initialize to READY per contract, so FAIL_FAST cancels READY roots and the other policies leave independent roots at READY. (3) Fixed test_run_diamond_dependency to use set() comparison on succeeded_nodes since contract does not mandate ordering.
